@startuml bounded-contexts
left to right direction
rectangle "Architecture Authority" as architecture
rectangle "Agentic Delivery Control Plane" as control
rectangle "Agentic Primitives" as primitives
rectangle "Developer Distribution" as distribution
rectangle ".github" as public
rectangle ".github-private" as private
architecture --> control : governs
architecture --> primitives : governs
primitives --> private : promotes
primitives --> distribution : releases
distribution --> control : thin integration
public ..> control : bootstrap reference
@enduml
